[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/2920328176","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/1996#issuecomment-2920328176","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1996","id":2920328176,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs6uEKvw","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T19:08:29Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T19:08:54Z","body":"```jsx\n<Field.Root>\n  <Field.Label />\n  <Field.Control type=\"color\" />\n  <Field.Error />\n</Field.Root>\n```\n@cgatian At a minimum, something like this would set `data-dirty/touched/filled/focused` based on the input. You could also use the [constraint validation API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Extensions/Forms/Form_validation#the_constraint_validation_api) to set `data-valid/invalid` as well, though the support depends on the specific input type.\n\nHere's a sandbox: https://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/stoic-pine-k39g7h?file=%2Fsrc%2FApp.tsx","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/2920328176/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/2920381642","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/1996#issuecomment-2920381642","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1996","id":2920381642,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs6uEXzK","user":{"login":"cgatian","id":1752170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1752170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian","html_url":"https://github.com/cgatian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T19:32:17Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T19:36:59Z","body":"That's my fault!  I should've given a more concrete example that _can't_ use the existing `Field.Control`.\n\nHow would one implement a `textarea` that participates in Form validation? I _think_ you would need to import the proper hooks (`useFieldRootContext`) and bind the proper events similar to the `Field.Control` today. But I _don't_ think those are exported.\n\nAlso, thank you so much for the response!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/2920381642/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/2920419920","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/1996#issuecomment-2920419920","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1996","id":2920419920,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs6uEhJQ","user":{"login":"cgatian","id":1752170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1752170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian","html_url":"https://github.com/cgatian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T19:50:22Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T20:08:54Z","body":"Perhaps youre supposed to override the `render` method of `Field.Control`?  That _does_ seem to work but due to incompatibilities between `HTMLInputElement` and `HTMLTextAreaElement` TypeScript is not happy. If this _is_ the way, perhaps `Field.Control` could take a generic `T = HTMLInputElement` and allow consumers to override the generic? \n\nThis is probably going down the wrong path. 😖 \nIf there _is_ proper way to do this, that's what I was requesting in Docs. I'd be happy to write something up once I understand the pattern.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/2920419920/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/2921033205","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/1996#issuecomment-2921033205","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1996","id":2921033205,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs6uG231","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T02:07:16Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T02:07:16Z","body":"`Field.Control` is meant to support any type of control (like `textarea`), not just `input`, but I believe we made the type simple for the time being. A generic could work though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/2921033205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/2948312698","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/1996#issuecomment-2948312698","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1996","id":2948312698,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs6vu656","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T07:09:34Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T07:09:34Z","body":"@cgatian the types use loose HTML props in the `render` prop - which part was erroring?\n\nBoth of these are accepted:\n```js\n<Field.Control render={<textarea />}\n```\n```jsx\n<Field.Control render={(props) => <textarea {...props />} />\n```\n\nIf you need to set textarea-only props, you use the element to render itself:\n\n```js\n<Field.Control render={<textarea rows={5} />}\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/2948312698/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"http